{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.Kaehler.Basic"],"declarations":40,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.D_eq_toCotangent_d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.D_eq_toCotangent_d","kind":"theorem","line":281,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L281-L286","doc":"Mathlib's universal derivation `D` is the class of our `d` in `I / I²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mem_Ω1_iff_mem_kaehler_ideal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mem_Ω1_iff_mem_kaehler_ideal","kind":"theorem","line":275,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L275-L279","doc":"For commutative `S`, `Ω¹(S) = ker μ` is exactly Mathlib's `KaehlerDifferential.ideal R S`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_unique","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L253-L265","doc":"**Uniqueness.** A left-`A`-linear `φ : Ω¹(A) → M` with `φ ∘ d = D` is `lift D`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_rsmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_rsmul","kind":"theorem","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L245-L250","doc":"`lift D` is right `A`-linear too, so it is a map of `A`-bimodules. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT_rmulT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT_rmulT","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L235-L243","doc":"How `liftT D` sees the right action, on all of `A ⊗ A`:\n`liftT D (z · b) = μ(z) • D b + b • liftT D z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_lsmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_lsmul","kind":"theorem","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L231-L233","doc":"`lift D` is left `A`-linear. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT_lmulT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT_lmulT","kind":"theorem","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L223-L228","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift_d","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L216-L220","doc":"`lift D ∘ d = D`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lift","kind":"def","line":213,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L213-L214","doc":"The induced map on `Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT_tmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT_tmul","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L211-L211","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.liftT","kind":"def","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L203-L208","doc":"The induced map `Ω¹(A) → M`, `Σ xᵢ ⊗ yᵢ ↦ Σ xᵢ • D yᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.map_one_of_leibniz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.map_one_of_leibniz","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L196-L201","doc":"A Leibniz map vanishes on `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.isCompl_Ω1_range_unitSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.isCompl_Ω1_range_unitSection","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L169-L186","doc":"**`A ⊗ A = Ω¹(A) ⊕ (A ⊗ 1)`.**  The kernel of `μ` and the range of the\nunit section are complementary submodules: every `z` splits uniquely as\n`(z − μ(z) ⊗ 1) + μ(z) ⊗ 1`.  Equivalently `μ` restricts to an\nisomorphism `A ⊗ 1 ≅ A`, so the part of `A ⊗ A` that `μ` sees is\nexactly the part `Ω¹(A)` misses. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.tmul_one_mem_Ω1_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.tmul_one_mem_Ω1_iff","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L164-L166","doc":"`a ⊗ 1` is a one-form only when `a = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mul'_unitSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mul'_unitSection","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L161-L162","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.unitSection_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.unitSection_apply","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L159-L159","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.unitSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.unitSection","kind":"def","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L155-L157","doc":"The **unit section** `A → A ⊗ A`, `a ↦ a ⊗ 1`.  It is a right inverse\nof `μ`, and its range is the complement of `Ω¹(A)` below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen_of_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen_of_mem","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L149-L152","doc":"Every element of `Ω¹(A)` is `Σ xᵢ · d yᵢ`: `gen` is a retraction onto `Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen_coe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen_coe","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L141-L147","doc":"**Generation by `d`.** `gen z = z − μ(z) ⊗ 1` in `A ⊗ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen_tmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen_tmul","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L139-L139","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.gen","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L132-L137","doc":"The `R`-linear map `A ⊗ A → Ω¹(A)`, `x ⊗ y ↦ x · d y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d_mul","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L127-L130","doc":"**Leibniz rule** for the universal derivation: `d (a b) = a · d b + (d a) · b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul_mul","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L119-L125","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lsmul_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lsmul_mul","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L111-L117","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul_lsmul_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul_lsmul_comm","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L101-L109","doc":"The two actions commute, so `Ω¹(A)` is an `A`-bimodule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul_coe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul_coe","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L98-L99","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lsmul_coe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lsmul_coe","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L95-L96","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rsmul","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L90-L93","doc":"The right `A`-action on `Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lsmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lsmul","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L85-L88","doc":"The left `A`-action on `Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mul'_rmulT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mul'_rmulT","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L78-L83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mul'_lmulT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mul'_lmulT","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L71-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rmulT_tmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rmulT_tmul","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lmulT_tmul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lmulT_tmul","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rmulT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.rmulT","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L65-L66","doc":"Right multiplication on the second factor, `x ⊗ y ↦ x ⊗ y b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lmulT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.lmulT","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L62-L63","doc":"Left multiplication on the first factor, `x ⊗ y ↦ a x ⊗ y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d_one","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d_coe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d_coe","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.d","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L50-L54","doc":"The universal derivation `d a = 1 ⊗ a − a ⊗ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mem_Ω1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.mem_Ω1","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.Ω1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.UniversalDifferentials.Ω1","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/UniversalDifferentials.lean#L45-L46","doc":"`Ω¹(A) = ker(μ : A ⊗[R] A → A)`, the universal first-order differential calculus. ","signatureChunk":0}]}